--- RSET: reference National_CF-3300
Ok
10 OPEN "R.DAT" AS #1 LEN=6
20 FIELD #1,6 AS A$
30 RSET A$="HI":PRINT "[";A$;"]"
40 B$="AB":RSET B$="HELLO":PRINT B$
50 ON ERROR GOTO 80
60 RSET A$
70 CLOSE:END
80 PRINT "Error";ERR:RESUME NEXT
RUN
[    HI]
HE
Error 2
Ok
color   auto    goto    list    run
